{"lang":"ko","dir":"ltr","title":"C&#39;s Cuts | 캘리포니아 페어필드 바버숍: 페이드, 테이퍼 &amp; 라인업","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">본문으로 건너뛰기</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">C&#39;s</span><span>C&#39;s Cuts</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"#about\">소개</a><a href=\"#services\">서비스</a><a href=\"#faq\">자주 묻는 질문</a><a href=\"#gallery\">사진</a><a href=\"#reviews\">리뷰</a><a href=\"#visit\">영업시간 및 위치</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"언어\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\">Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\">Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\">中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\">हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\" selected>한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17076737601\">전화</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('images/storefront.jpg')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">바버숍 · 캘리포니아 페어필드 · 2010년부터</p>\n    <h1>C&#39;s Cuts</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">깔끔한 페이드, 선명한 라인업, 서두르지 않는 바버. 2010년부터 페어필드 동네 바버숍.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/C%27s+Cuts/@38.2697674,-122.0337414,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085167f609079b9:0x6d44cf17cd1bec5c!8m2!3d38.2697674!4d-122.0337414!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.8 · Google 리뷰 135개<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17076737601\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> 전화로 자리 잡기</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=C&#39;s%20Cuts%2C%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%2C%20Fairfield%2C%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> 길찾기</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li>2010년 오픈</li><li>예약 없이 방문 환영</li><li>현금 또는 Zelle</li><li>어린이 커트</li><li>전용 주차장</li><li>휠체어 접근 가능</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">가게 소개</p><h2>서두르지 않습니다. 멋진 커트만 있을 뿐.</h2><p>C&#39;s Cuts(C&#39;s Barber Shop이라고도 불림)는 2010년부터 North Texas Street에서 머리를 잘라 왔습니다. 깔끔한 커트, 테이퍼, 페이드, 크루컷, 다듬기, 면도칼 라인업이 전문입니다.</p><p>Chris, Christine과 저희 팀은 서두르지 않고 디테일에 신경 쓰며, 편하게 이야기 나눌 수 있습니다. 아이를 데려오시는 부모님도 많아요.</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/C%27s+Cuts/@38.2697674,-122.0337414,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085167f609079b9:0x6d44cf17cd1bec5c!8m2!3d38.2697674!4d-122.0337414!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.8★</b><span>리뷰 135개</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>예약 없이</b><span>환영</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>2010</b><span>오픈</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/fade-cut.jpg\" alt=\"C&#39;s Cuts에서 막 자른 페이드\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">의자에 앉으면</p><h2>커트 &amp; 서비스</h2><p>저희가 자신 있는 스타일입니다. 원하는 스타일이 있으면 바버에게 말씀하세요.</p></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>깔끔한 커트</h3></div><p>늘 하던 스타일을 원하시는 모양으로 깔끔하게 정리해 드립니다.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>페이드</h3></div><p>로우, 미드, 하이, 볼드 페이드를 깔끔하게 블렌딩.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>테이퍼</h3></div><p>목선과 관자놀이를 깔끔하게 테이퍼.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>크루컷</h3></div><p>짧고 클래식하며 관리가 쉬운 스타일.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>다듬기</h3></div><p>길이는 유지하고 전체를 깔끔하게 정리.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">06</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>면도칼 라인업</h3></div><p>일자 면도칼로 마무리한 선명한 라인.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">07</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>어린이 커트</h3></div><p>아이들(그리고 까다로운 부모님)에게도 인내심 있는 바버.</p></article></div><p class=\"note\">가격은 온라인에 올리지 않습니다. 현재 가격은 (707) 673-7601로 전화 주세요. 결제: 현금 또는 Zelle만 가능.</p></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">알아두세요</p><h2>방문 전 안내</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>예약 없이 방문 환영</b></li><li><b>현금 또는 Zelle</b><span>신용카드 불가</span></li><li><b>전용 주차장</b><span>도로 밖, 조명 있는 주차장, 앞뒤 출입구</span></li><li><b>자전거 주차</b></li><li><b>휠체어 접근 가능</b></li><li><b>어린이 커트</b><span>아이를 데려오는 부모님이 많아요</span></li><li><b>2010년 오픈</b></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">갤러리</p><h2>가게에서</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/fade-cut.jpg\" alt=\"선명한 라인업을 더한 스킨 페이드\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/textured-cut.jpg\" alt=\"윗머리를 길게 남긴 텍스처 페이드\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/storefront.jpg\" alt=\"2240 N Texas St의 C&#39;s Cuts 매장 앞\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/storefront-2.jpg\" alt=\"이발소 표시등이 있는 C&#39;s Cuts 입구\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">리뷰</p><h2>페어필드 단골들의 의자</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.8</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 리뷰 135개</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/C%27s+Cuts/@38.2697674,-122.0337414,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085167f609079b9:0x6d44cf17cd1bec5c!8m2!3d38.2697674!4d-122.0337414!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google에서 리뷰 더 보기 →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.5</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Yelp</b> · 리뷰 34개</div><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp에서 리뷰 더 보기 →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Woke up this morning took a quick glance in the mirror; and thought to myself &quot;Dam C!!!! you did a great job on the haircut....Thnx Bro!!&quot; Cya on the nxt1”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Best haircut I’ve had in my two years in Cali and I’ll definitely be here every month. I recommend this shop to anyone who wants a legit cut for a legit price (don’t forget to tip). They make sure you’re not looking in the mirror afterwards wondering why you still go to them.”</blockquote><figcaption>— T&#39;Arris B. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Found my new go to barber in Fairfield. Chris and Christine are cool people, and all the barbers know what they’re doing. My first time I got a fresh fade from Christine. They take their time to give you the best cut for your money. Definitely recommend checking them out. Support your local Filipino shop!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Thomas A. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Just got a cut from Chris and it was honestly one of the best I’ve had. He took his time, paid attention to every detail, and the fade came out super clean. The top was shaped perfectly, and you can tell he genuinely cares about his clients. He’s down to earth, easy to talk to, and really takes pride in what he does. If you’re looking for someone who doesn’t rush and delivers high-quality work, Chris is the one.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · May 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“C’s Barbershop is great. I get my haircut by Chris. He’s a stand up guy — a great barber and friend. Always offers good conversation and takes pride in his craft. I always leave the shop feeling good about myself. My friend also gets his haircut by Chris’ wife, and she is talented as well. Affordable prices and great company has me coming back as a regular!”</blockquote><figcaption>— James R. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“C&#39;s cuts has been my go-to place for almost 15 years for my hair cut needs. The environment is always great, and well-rounded barbers with steady hands are always hard to find, especially ones for such a great price. I truly recommend everybody to get their cuts, line ups, and fades at C&#39;s. You won&#39;t regret how great you look and feel afterward”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Chris and Christine takes their time to cut my hair. They are both very skilled barbers. Highly recommended if you want a nice clean and sharp looking haircut. Hint: go to either Chris and Christine first for your first time haircut.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Alexander C. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I’ve been coming to this place for a couple years now, and they’ve always been really kind and understanding. Before finding this place I had a really rough time finding someone who could cut my hair the way I like it, and by my surprise I found it down the street from me. 100/100 I’d recommend this place, and if you’re into a more chilled out vibe this is the place.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Aug 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I have two young boys and I can be very picky on who cuts their hair. I tend to have the usual people cut their hair but unfortunately none of them were available. I decided to go where my nephew always goes, C’s Barbershop. Let me just say that I’m very impressed !! Shoutout to the talented female who cut their hair! I wish I knew her name! I will definitely be bringing them back to her :)”</blockquote><figcaption>— Jeanette A. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">자주 묻는 질문</p><h2>궁금한 점을 알려드려요</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>예약이 필요한가요?</summary><p>아니요, 그냥 들어오세요. 예약을 원하시거나 대기 시간을 확인하고 싶으시면 (707) 673-7601로 전화 주세요.</p></details><details><summary>신용카드 받나요?</summary><p>신용카드는 받지 않습니다. 현금 또는 Zelle로 결제해 주세요.</p></details><details><summary>영업시간은 어떻게 되나요?</summary><p>월요일–토요일 오전 10시–오후 5시 영업하며 일요일은 쉽니다. 시간은 바뀔 수 있으니 미리 전화 주세요.</p></details><details><summary>주차는 어디에 하나요?</summary><p>전용 주차장이 있고 출입구는 앞과 뒤 두 곳입니다.</p></details><details><summary>아이들 머리도 자르나요?</summary><p>네! 아들을 데려오시는 부모님이 많아요.</p></details><details><summary>가게는 언제부터 운영했나요?</summary><p>2010년부터 운영하고 있습니다.</p></details><details><summary>휠체어로 들어갈 수 있나요?</summary><p>네, 휠체어 접근이 가능합니다.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">방문 안내</p>\n      <h2>영업시간 및 위치</h2>\n      <address>2240 N Texas St<br>Fairfield, CA 94533</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17076737601\">(707) 673-7601</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>월요일</td><td>10 AM – 5 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>화요일</td><td>10 AM – 5 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>수요일</td><td>10 AM – 5 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>목요일</td><td>10 AM – 5 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>금요일</td><td>10 AM – 5 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>토요일</td><td>10 AM – 5 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>일요일</td><td>휴무</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">영업시간은 바뀔 수 있으니 전화로 확인해 주세요.</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/C%27s+Cuts/@38.2697674,-122.0337414,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085167f609079b9:0x6d44cf17cd1bec5c!8m2!3d38.2697674!4d-122.0337414!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Google reviews</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Yelp</span></a></div>\n      <div class=\"cta-row\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17076737601\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill